{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2592c46a116520f44d2168581c72eaed375d705e6bb5e36c4449c1e43b0b0a8b", "ja": "ジュリア、新しい衣装はどうだ？\nなにかあったら、今のうちに言っておいてくれ。", "zh": "茱莉亚，新服装怎么样？\n要是有什么问题，就趁现在先说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "d83fa58dfff363e998f53e0fa3713f3f14848ded89bb3c616339dda92ab25839", "ja": "ないね！　最高だよ。\n今のあたしにピッタリの衣装だ。", "zh": "没有！棒极了。\n这身衣服正适合现在的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "9113e0562b02949f2b36a02ffadb6cc36dc387d19c23c43564136547036c0334", "ja": "着てるだけで、フレーズが湧いてくるっていうか……。\nとにかく、早くステージに出たくなるよ！", "zh": "光是穿着它，就感觉歌词不断涌上心头……总之，真想赶紧登上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1003_p", "source_sha256": "745680c1f591df3f31c9e95e65c524e584e23a7e69442654cced765c3e444eea", "ja": "ずいぶん気に入ってくれたみたいだな。\nちなみに、どこがそんなに気に入ったんだ？", "zh": "看来你真的很喜欢啊。\n顺便问一下，你到底喜欢它哪一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "a11ec3533e0726f130ba33ba7c4e5e158290d814e6c01d8dbb9acbc684a4cfe5", "ja": "どこって……全部だよ、全部！\nいいか？　こういうのはフィーリングなんだ。", "zh": "你问喜欢哪里……当然是全部啊，全部！\n明白吗？这种事靠的是感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "ff15fe3f1f4a02a1c37b83fa4c84b97db977d935a7b446a8ffbc765fad6363f6", "ja": "好きになるのに、理由はいらないって言うだろ？\nそういうコト！", "zh": "不是常说喜欢上一个人不需要理由吗？\n就是这个道理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3adac12c1448ba25edc4b62ab7fc50b6b620bbb4fe13825a769e6d4f5aab8ccf", "ja": "そうか、今後の参考にと思ったんだけど……。\nまあ俺のフィーリングからしても、よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "这样啊，我本来还想作为今后的参考来着……不过凭我的感觉，也很适合你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "c35f4d9dfe31893f01c435691af8625d2d77d179b4f3a2179d650b5a4707b6e3", "ja": "ははっ、ありがとな、{$P$}。\nあんたがそう言うなら安心だな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你，{$P$}。\n既然你都这么说了，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "c9c2e80c244d7d4e5e92c163542142cecc4ec69dd8286d6931ce532a7802140f", "ja": "くーっ！　ウズウズしてきた。\n今すぐ路上に飛び出して、1曲やりたいくらいだ。", "zh": "唔——！我已经按捺不住了。\n真想现在就冲到街头，表演1首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2231c40385ec8158020cd9f7e7859cc3032de0698adef72b303f47f72f716440", "ja": "い、いや、それはちょっと……。\nその熱意は、ステージまで取っておいてくれよ。", "zh": "不、不是，这有点……\n这份热情，还是留到舞台上再去释放吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "009dc10db82f8e04496b147af9d4e199f51e21afccbdb7e2083b8b3fce671a4d", "ja": "わかってるって！\nちゃんと抑え込んでおくさ。", "zh": "我知道啦！\n我会好好按捺住的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "1f8b5357f3a6b03af3a41b1168285a8bd2bba21aed76a0260afc037d780a0ddb", "ja": "本番で爆発させられるように……。\n今からじっくり、熱をため込んでおくよ。", "zh": "为了能在正式演出时爆发出来……现在开始，我要好好把热情积攒起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "609a3edeba25148a86afcf7775eb0d6d90f154eed12b1f34450c324f60be63ee", "ja": "そう、ガマンだ、ガマン……。", "zh": "对，要忍耐，忍耐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fac2144b809427b8fa66966b94745a39c17275b162b7369c657a7e8d58cddc92", "ja": "ってジュリア、どこに行く気だ？", "zh": "喂，茱莉亚，你打算去哪儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "25722731d98a959d817b412fe05bfba7d312507799c90fcfa2c92ffac0281846", "ja": "え、あ、いや……ちょっと。\nギター取ってこようかなーって……。", "zh": "诶，啊，不是……就是有点事。\n我想去把吉他拿过来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8bdf8e456f4117231943af94578b3e054d52d63da9416aad84d19303256ef68b", "ja": "抑え込めてないじゃないか！", "zh": "根本就没压住吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "1784e2b77929e0ee2b4446e9859597cea4b64ce3ca47937b1b6d33676f5f0539", "ja": "ち、違うって！　ええと……そう！　確認だよ、確認！\nほら、チューニングとか、ちゃんとしておかないとさ。", "zh": "不、不是那样！那个……对！是确认，确认啦！\n你看，调音之类的，不好好弄妥可不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "6372eb16ef14652c343e8e1d97177bf6dc368c23b74748d0b1d306da2f1c40b0", "ja": "あいつはあたしの相棒だからな。ちゃんと手入れして\nおかないと。本番で機嫌悪くされたら困るからな！", "zh": "那家伙可是我的搭档啊。不事先好好保养可不行。要是在正式演出时闹脾气，我可就头疼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6e6c1bfd3acb1918ae9f5b9d2c997e164d6bf48dcf30435b06ab1a9d26839c09", "ja": "なるほど……そういうことにしておくよ。\n本番のステージは、期待させてくれるって事だよな？", "zh": "原来如此……那就当是这么回事吧。\n正式演出的舞台，会让人期待的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "db8ca7af1746ef4df60f4edee1361ab69e39fd9e6473dcd3a4f785e1a2d62f52", "ja": "うっ……そういう言い方はズルいぞ！\nま、言われなくたって、やってやるけどな♪", "zh": "呜……这么说也太狡猾了吧！\n不过，就算你不说，我也会全力以赴的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0224_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "3eba075067156172862487dde8913a98c41aed2a145a6be6a25a61bac5d6c98d", "ja": "今のあたしはひと味違うぜ？\n一瞬だって目を離すなよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "现在的我可不一样了哦？\n一瞬都不许移开视线，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
